### WhatsApp Campaign Manager - API Testing
### Base URL
@base_url = http://localhost:5000

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH & STATUS ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================

### 1. Health Check - Verify API is running
GET {{base_url}}/health

### 2. Ready Check - Verify all dependencies are connected
GET {{base_url}}/ready

### ============================================================================
### WHATSAPP SESSION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================

### 3. Connect WhatsApp Session - Get QR Code
### Creates a new session and returns QR code for WhatsApp scanning
POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionName": "session1"
}

### 4. Connect Second Session
POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionName": "session2"
}

### 5. Get All Sessions - List all connected/pending sessions
GET {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/sessions

### ============================================================================
### CAMPAIGN MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================

### 6. Add Contacts to Campaign - Bulk add phone numbers
### Max 1000 contacts per request
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "user_id": 100,
  "contacts": [
    "919876543210",
    "911234567890",
    "919988776655",
    "918765432109",
    "917654321098"
  ]
}

### 7. Add More Contacts (Batch 2)
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "user_id": 100,
  "contacts": [
    "916543210987",
    "915432109876",
    "914321098765",
    "913210987654",
    "912109876543"
  ]
}

### 8. Add Contacts to Different Campaign
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 2,
  "user_id": 101,
  "contacts": [
    "919123456789",
    "918234567890"
  ]
}

### 9. Start Campaign - Send messages to all contacts
### Replace campaign ID (1) with your actual campaign ID
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/start/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageTemplate": "Hello! Welcome to our exclusive campaign. Thanks for joining us."
}

### 10. Start Campaign with Template Variables
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/start/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageTemplate": "Hi {{name}}, your campaign code is {{code}}. Valid until {{expiry_date}}"
}

### 11. Get Campaign Status - Check message delivery progress
### Replace campaign ID (1) with your actual campaign ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/1/status

### 12. Get Job Status - Check specific job progress
GET {{base_url}}/api/campaign/job/campaign-1-1715755200000/status

### ============================================================================
### ERROR TEST CASES
### ============================================================================

### 13. Test Validation - Invalid session name (special characters)
POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionName": "session@123"
}

### 14. Test Validation - Invalid session name (too short)
POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionName": "ab"
}

### 15. Test Validation - Missing required field
POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalidField": "test"
}

### 16. Test Validation - Invalid phone number format
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "user_id": 100,
  "contacts": [
    "123"
  ]
}

### 17. Test Validation - Empty contacts array
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "user_id": 100,
  "contacts": []
}

### 18. Test Validation - Too many contacts (max 1000)
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaign_id": 1,
  "user_id": 100,
  "contacts": [
    "919876543210",
    "919876543211",
    "919876543212",
    "919876543213",
    "919876543214",
    "919876543215",
    "919876543216",
    "919876543217",
    "919876543218",
    "919876543219"
  ]
}

### 19. Test - Empty message template
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/start/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageTemplate": ""
}

### 20. Test - Message too long (max 4096 characters)
POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/start/1
Content-Type: application/json

