### ============================================================================
### TYPICAL WORKFLOW
### ============================================================================

### Step 1: Check system health
# GET {{base_url}}/health

### Step 2: Connect WhatsApp session
# POST {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/connect
# {
#   "sessionName": "mySession"
# }
# --> Scan the QR code returned in response

### Step 3: Verify session is connected
# GET {{base_url}}/api/whatsapp/sessions

### Step 4: Add contacts to campaign
# POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/add-contacts
# {
#   "campaign_id": 1,
#   "user_id": 100,
#   "contacts": ["919876543210", "911234567890"]
# }

### Step 5: Start campaign
# POST {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/start/1
# {
#   "messageTemplate": "Hello, this is our campaign message!"
# }

### Step 6: Monitor progress
# GET {{base_url}}/api/campaign/campaign/1/status
# (Repeat this endpoint periodically to get updated status)
